# builtin-resolve rejects a Value::Program — callers must resolve per-document.
# Parse "42" to get a Program, then pass the Program directly to builtin-resolve.
# builtin-resolve expects a Document; passing a Program produces a user error.
[
  parsed: [builtin-parse [builtin-str-bytes "42"] "test.llt"]
  desug: [builtin-desugar parsed.program]
  [builtin-resolve desug []]
]

=== error
builtin-resolve: Value::Program is no longer accepted
